# `for (const row of rows) { if (row.skip) continue; line += tell(row); }`: every turn that appends runs other code. A step through a list is cheap with a builder, so the text stays in one.
# The same over a Map, whose turns are quicker with a builder, too.
# f1 = told, f2 = toldOfTable
